@startuml 24_timing
!include _style.iuml
title Timing Diagram — one Sales run with a confirmed order (seconds; illustrative timings)\nbudgets: deadline 60 s, ≤ 6 model calls, ≤ 4 tool calls

scale 1 as 90 pixels
robust "Inbound Message" as MSG
robust "AgentRun" as RUN
robust "SpecialistAgent" as SA
robust "Order" as ORD
concise "Tool budget used" as TB

@0
MSG is RECEIVED
RUN is "{-}"
SA is Idle
ORD is "{-}"
TB is "0 / 4"

@1
MSG is PROCESSING
RUN is RUNNING
SA is BuildContext

@2
SA is AwaitLLM

@4
SA is AwaitTool
TB is "1 / 4"

@5
SA is AwaitLLM

@7
SA is AwaitTool
ORD is CREATED
TB is "2 / 4"

@8
SA is AwaitLLM

@10
SA is AwaitTool
ORD is CONFIRMED
TB is "3 / 4"

@11
SA is AwaitLLM

@13
SA is Done
RUN is SUCCEEDED
MSG is PROCESSED

@15
SA is Idle

RUN@1 <-> @13 : run took 12 s of the 60 s deadline
SA@2 <-> @4 : model call 1
@enduml
